    "code": "/// Sums 1 .. n inclusive — an ordinary function, usable at compile time.\nsize_t triangular(size_t n)\n{\n    size_t acc;\n    foreach (i; 1 .. n + 1)\n        acc += i;\n    return acc;\n}\n\nenum tenth = triangular(10);\nstatic immutable size_t[3] firstThree = [triangular(1), triangular(2), triangular(3)];\n",
